ros-jazzy-plansys2-support-py (4.0.0-1noble) noble; urgency=high

  * One version for Humble, Jazzy, Kilted and Lyrical (#509 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/509>)
  * Robust PlanSys2: one node per component, clients that wait, retry and see a lost plan (#507 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/507>)
  * Execute everything Kairos plans: conditional effects, durations, timed literals, object fluents, recursive derived predicates, PDDL+ and constraints (#504 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/504>)
  * Fixes in the executor, the build, the tests and the CI (#502 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/502>)
  * Fixes in the Python support, the terminal, and the rqt and TUI tools (#500 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/500>)
  * ActionExecutor and performers: one request, its own messages (#488 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/488>)
  * Problem metric from Python, the terminal and the TUI (#463 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/463>)
  * forall and imply in conditions, goals and effects (#462 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/462>)
  * Tests discover only nodes on this host (#455 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/455>)
  * Performers, executor clients and the TUI notice when PlanSys2 goes down (#448 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/448>)
  * Consistent executor goal handling: cancels, replaced goals and result codes (#439 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/439>)
  * Update domain during execution (#414 <https://github.com/PlanSys2/ros2_planning_system/pull/414>)
  * Contributors: Francisco Martín Rico

